ivating the canonical NF-kappa-B pathway or (2) trigger programmed cell death (apoptosis and necroptosis) (PubMed:16284179). Impairs regulatory T-cells (Treg) function in individuals with rheumatoid arthritis via FOXP3 dephosphorylation: acts by up-regulating the expression of protein phosphatase 1 (PP1), which dephosphorylates the key \'Ser-418\' residue of FOXP3, thereby inactivating FOXP3 and rendering Treg cells functionally defective (PubMed:23396208). Key mediator of cell death in the anticancer action of BCG-stimulated neutrophils in combination with DIABLO/SMAC mimetic in the RT4v6 bladder cancer cell line (PubMed:16829952, PubMed:22517918, PubMed:23396208). Induces insulin resistance in adipocytes via inhibition of insulin-induced IRS1 tyrosine phosphorylation and insulin-induced glucose uptake (By similarity). Induces GKAP42 protein degradation in adipocytes which is partially responsible for TNF-induced insulin resistance (By similarity). Plays a role in angiogenesis by inducing VEGF production synergistically with IL1B and IL6 (PubMed:12794819). Promotes osteoclastogenesis and therefore mediates bone resorption (By similarity)\"},{\"evidences\":[{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000269\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"11592999\"},{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000269\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"16284179\"},{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000269\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"33495445\"},{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000269\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"3883195\"},{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000269\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"6392892\"}],\"value\":\"Cytokine mainly secreted by macrophages that binds to TNFRSF1A/TNFR1 and TNFRSF1B/TNFBR, activating the tumor necrosis factor-mediated (TNF) signaling pathway (PubMed:11592999, PubMed:16284179, PubMed:33495445, PubMed:3883195, PubMed:6392892). The TNF signaling pathway acts as a master regulator of the immune system, which either (1) promotes cell survival and inflammation by activating the canonical NF-kappa-B pathway or (2) trigger programmed cell death (apoptosis and necroptosis) (PubMed:16284179)\"},{\"evidences\":[{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000269\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"16829952\"}],\"value\":\"The TNF intracellular domain (ICD) form induces IL12 production in dendritic cells\"},{\"evidences\":[{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000269\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"16829952\"}],\"value\":\"The TNF intracellular domain (ICD) form induces IL12 production in dendritic cells\"}]','[{\"id\":\"GO:0009986\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"cell surface\",\"evidence_type\":\"IDA:BHF-UCL\",\"evidences\":[{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000314\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"18355445\"}]},{\"id\":\"GO:0009897\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"external side of plasma membrane\",\"evidence_type\":\"ISS:BHF-UCL\",\"evidences\":[]},{\"id\":\"GO:0005576\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"extracellular region\",\"evidence_type\":\"IDA:BHF-UCL\",\"evidences\":[{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000314\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"10443688\"},{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000314\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"12594207\"},{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000314\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"18355445\"},{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000314\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"21323571\"},{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000314\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"3932069\"}]},{\"id\":\"GO:0045121\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"membrane raft\",\"evidence_type\":\"IDA:BHF-UCL\",\"evidences\":[{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000314\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"17010968\"}]},{\"id\":\"GO:0043025\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"neuronal cell body\",\"evidence_type\":\"IEA:Ensembl\",\"evidences\":[]},{\"id\":\"GO:0001891\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"phagocytic cup\",\"evidence_type\":\"ISS:BHF-UCL\",\"evidences\":[]},{\"id\":\"GO:0005886\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"plasma membrane\",\"evidence_type\":\"IDA:BHF-UCL\",\"evidences\":[{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000314\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"18355445\"}]},{\"id\":\"GO:0055037\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"rec