ndependent of transcription. Induces the transcription of long intergenic non-coding RNA p21 (lincRNA-p21) and lincRNA-Mkln1. LincRNA-p21 participates in TP53-dependent transcriptional repression leading to apoptosis and seems to have an effect on cell-cycle regulation. Implicated in Notch signaling cross-over. Prevents CDK7 kinase activity when associated to CAK complex in response to DNA damage, thus stopping cell cycle progression. Isoform 2 enhances the transactivation activity of isoform 1 from some but not all TP53-inducible promoters. Isoform 4 suppresses transactivation activity and impairs growth suppression mediated by isoform 1. Isoform 7 inhibits isoform 1-mediated apoptosis. Regulates the circadian clock by repressing CLOCK-BMAL1-mediated transcriptional activation of PER2 (PubMed:24051492)\"}]','[{\"id\":\"GO:0005813\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"centrosome\",\"evidence_type\":\"IDA:UniProtKB\",\"evidences\":[{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000314\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"28842590\"}]},{\"id\":\"GO:0000785\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"chromatin\",\"evidence_type\":\"IDA:BHF-UCL\",\"evidences\":[{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000314\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"15710329\"},{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000314\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"17805299\"},{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000314\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"22521434\"},{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000314\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"23629966\"},{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000314\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"24289924\"}]},{\"id\":\"GO:0005737\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"cytoplasm\",\"evidence_type\":\"IDA:UniProtKB\",\"evidences\":[{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000314\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"16131611\"},{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000314\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"19011621\"},{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000314\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"20096447\"},{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000314\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"20810912\"},{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000314\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":