,\"source\":\"UniProtKB\",\"id\":\"P51587\"}],\"value\":\"Colocalizes with ERCC5/XPG to nuclear foci following DNA replication stress\"}]}},{\"location\":{\"evidences\":[{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000250\",\"source\":\"UniProtKB\",\"id\":\"P51587\"}],\"value\":\"Cytoplasm, cytoskeleton, microtubule organizing center, centrosome\",\"id\":\"SL-0048\"},\"topology\":null,\"orientation\":null,\"molecule\":null,\"note\":{\"texts\":[{\"evidences\":[{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000250\",\"source\":\"UniProtKB\",\"id\":\"P51587\"}],\"value\":\"Colocalizes with ERCC5/XPG to nuclear foci following DNA replication stress\"}]}}]','1: Evidence at protein level',5,'{\"firstPublicDate\":\"1998-12-15\",\"lastAnnotationUpdateDate\":\"2026-11-04\",\"lastSequenceUpdateDate\":\"2012-10-03\",\"entryVersion\":210,\"sequenceVersion\":2}','https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/P97929');
INSERT INTO `p3_uniprot` VALUES (61,'development','mouse','10090','12638','P26361','Cystic fibrosis transmembrane conductance regulator',1,1,'exact_GeneID_cross_reference','Epithelial ion channel that plays an important role in the regulation of epithelial ion and water transport and fluid homeostasis (PubMed:26823428). Mediates the transport of chloride ions across the cell membrane (PubMed:20231442, PubMed:22265409). Possesses an intrinsic ATPase activity and utilizes ATP to gate its channel; the passive flow of anions through the channel is gated by cycles of ATP binding and hydrolysis by the ATP-binding domains (By similarity). The ion channel is also permeable to HCO(3)(-); selectivity depends on the extracellular chloride concentration. Exerts its function also by modulating the activity of other ion channels and transporters. Contributes to the regulation of the pH and the ion content of the epithelial fluid layer. Modulates the activity of the epithelial sodium channel (ENaC) complex, in part by regulating the cell surface expression of the ENaC complex. May regulate bicarbonate secretion and salvage in epithelial cells by regulating the transporter SLC4A7. Can inhibit the chloride channel activity of ANO1 (By similarity). Plays a role in the chloride and bicarbonate homeostasis during sperm epididymal maturation and capacitation (PubMed:21976599)','[\"GO:0005254\",\"GO:0005260\",\"GO:0005524\",\"GO:0015106\",\"GO:0015108\",\"GO:0016887\",\"GO:0019869\",\"GO:0019899\",\"GO:0030165\",\"GO:0042802\",\"GO:0051087\",\"GO:0071889\",\"GO:0106138\",\"GO:0140359\"]','[\"GO:0006695\",\"GO:0006821\",\"GO:0006833\",\"GO:0009410\",\"GO:0015701\",\"GO:0030301\",\"GO:0030321\",\"GO:0030324\",\"GO:0033005\",\"GO:0034976\",\"GO:0035377\",\"GO:0035725\",\"GO:0042311\",\"GO:0048240\",\"GO:0050891\",\"GO:0051454\",\"GO:0060081\",\"GO:0070166\",\"GO:0070175\",\"GO:0071320\",\"GO:0097186\",\"GO:1902476\",\"GO:1904322\",\"GO:1904446\",\"GO:1905460\",\"GO:2000077\"]','[\"GO:0005634\",\"GO:0005737\",\"GO:0005769\",\"GO:0005789\",\"GO:0005829\",\"GO:0005886\",\"GO:0005902\",\"GO:0009986\",\"GO:0016020\",\"GO:0016323\",\"GO:0016324\",\"GO:0030425\",\"GO:0031901\",\"GO:0032991\",\"GO:0043025\",\"GO:0055037\",\"GO:0055038\"]','[\"SL-0015\",\"SL-0039\",\"SL-0093\",\"SL-0097\",\"SL-0191\",\"SL-0231\"]','[\"Apical cell membrane\",\"Cell membrane\",\"Early endosome membrane\",\"Endoplasmic reticulum membrane\",\"Nucleus\",\"Recycling endosome membrane\"]','[{\"evidences\":[{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000250\",\"source\":\"UniProtKB\",\"id\":\"P13569\"},{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000269\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"19033647\"},{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000269\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"20231442\"},{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000269\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"21976599\"},{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000269\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"22265409\"},{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000269\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"26823428\"}],\"value\":\"Epithelial ion channel that plays an important role in the regulation of epithelial ion and water transport and fluid homeostasis (PubMed:26823428). Mediates the transport of chloride ions across the cell membrane (PubMed:20231442, PubMed:22265409). Possesses an intrinsic ATPase activity and utilizes ATP to gate its channel; the passive flow of anions through the channel is gated by cycles of ATP binding and hydrolysis by the ATP-binding domains (By similarity). The ion channel is also permeable to HCO(3)(-); selectivity depends on the extracellular chloride concentration. Exerts its function also by modulating the activity of other ion channels and transporters. Contributes to the regulation of the pH and the ion content of the epithelial fluid layer. Modulates the activity of the epithelial sodium channel (ENaC) complex, in part by regulating the cell surface expression of the ENaC complex. May regulate bicarbonate secretion and salvage in epithelial cells by regulating the transporter SLC4A7. Can inhibit the chloride channel activity of ANO1 (By similarity). Plays a role in the chloride and bicarbonate homeostasis during sperm epididymal maturation and capacitation (PubMed:21976599)\"}]','[{\"id\":\"GO:0016324\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"apical plasma membrane\",\"evidence_type\":\"IDA:UniProtKB\",\"evidences\":[{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000314\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"21884936\"}]},{\"id\":\"GO:0016323\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"basolateral plasma membrane\",\"evidence_type\":\"ISO:GO_Central\",\"evidences\":[]},{\"id\":\"GO:0009986\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"cell surface\",\"evidence_type\":\"ISO:GO_Central\",\"evidences\":[]},{\"id\":\"GO:0005737\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"cytoplasm\",\"evidence_type\":\"ISO:GO_Central\",\"evidences\":[]},{\"id\":\"GO:0005829\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"cytosol\",\"evidence_type\":\"IDA:UniProtKB\",\"evidences\":[{\"evidenceCode\":\"ECO:0000314\",\"source\":\"PubMed\",\"id\":\"24885604\"}]},{\"id\":\"GO:0030425\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"dendrite\",\"evidence_type\":\"ISO:GO_Central\",\"evidences\":[]},{\"id\":\"GO:0005769\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"early endosome\",\"evidence_type\":\"ISS:UniProtKB\",\"evidences\":[]},{\"id\":\"GO:0031901\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"early endosome membrane\",\"evidence_type\":\"ISS:UniProtKB\",\"evidences\":[]},{\"id\":\"GO:0005789\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"endoplasmic reticulum membrane\",\"evidence_type\":\"ISS:UniProtKB\",\"evidences\":[]},{\"id\":\"GO:0016020\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"membrane\",\"evidence_type\":\"ISS:UniProtKB\",\"evidences\":[]},{\"id\":\"GO:0005902\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"microvillus\",\"evidence_type\":\"ISO:GO_Central\",\"evidences\":[]},{\"id\":\"GO:0043025\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"neuronal cell body\",\"evidence_type\":\"ISO:GO_Central\",\"evidences\":[]},{\"id\":\"GO:0005634\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"nucleus\",\"evidence_type\":\"ISS:UniProtKB\",\"evidences\":[]},{\"id\":\"GO:0005886\",\"aspect\":\"C\",\"term\":\"plasma me